# TypeScript standards (Resolve)

Reference [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the full mandate.

- Use `const` only; no `let`, `var`, or IIFEs for variable init.
- Import types with `import type` (inline-type-imports).
- Use `SupabaseClient<Database>` — never bare `SupabaseClient` in domain code.
- Query with `supabase.from("literal_table")` and `supabase.rpc(...)`; no dynamic table strings, no `as unknown as` on builders.
- No `any`, `@ts-expect-error`, or `eslint-disable` without explicit user approval.
- Regenerate `database.types.ts` via `bun run db:types` when schema changes — do not add shim helpers.
- Expand `@typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-*` to new domains as Zod + typed rows land (RUN-73).
